WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.072
Let us build booking interface as a coherent visual system.

2
00:00:05.072 --> 00:00:12.068
Start with composition and reusable components, then move into motion, materials, and controlled variation.

3
00:00:12.468 --> 00:00:17.474
In Figma, build the booking flow from reusable components and responsive frames.

4
00:00:17.474 --> 00:00:25.547
Use Claude to explore clearer interface copy, then test a transition in After Effects without hiding the important state change.

5
00:00:25.947 --> 00:00:30.837
Adapt the concept in Canva and build a simple spatial treatment in Blender.

6
00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:38.920
Review the motion and format in Resolve, keeping typography, contrast, and interaction feedback consistent across surfaces.

7
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.152
Adapt the work into responsive design system.

8
00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:49.829
Compare formats side by side, preview the movement, and review the final experience at the size people will actually see.
